1589
01:29:16.225 --> 01:29:17.894
Don't you know I'm dead inside?

1590
01:29:17.927 --> 01:29:20.096
By the way,
your nose is bleeding.

1591
01:29:20.129 --> 01:29:21.464
Oh.

1592
01:29:21.497 --> 01:29:25.201
